{"title": "Merry Revelry", "pageid": 26339, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Merry_Revelry", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Merry Revelry</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Ethel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ethel\">Ethel</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Redcap\" title=\"Redcap\">Redcap</a> servants, that reduces the effect of their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodlust_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloodlust (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bloodlust\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodlust_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloodlust (Condition)\">Bloodlust</a> when attacking characters with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alcohol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\">Alcohol</a> in their blood.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This Redcap's Bloodlust is subdued when there are traces of alcohol in a target's blood, which means they will primarily target creatures who are sober. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Pete\" title=\"Flaming Pete\">Flaming Pete</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jatlo\" title=\"Jatlo\">Jatlo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Maggoty_Jim\" title=\"Maggoty Jim\">Maggoty Jim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Redcap_Boatswain\" title=\"Redcap Boatswain\">Redcap Boatswain</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Silas_Silvertongue\" title=\"Silas Silvertongue\">Silas Silvertongue</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202721\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal ti